---
// Who It's For & Who It's Not For - Setting Honest, Grounded Expectations
---

<section class="section section-who" id="who-its-for">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">Honest Expectations</span>
      <h2>Is Her First Income The Right Fit?</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in complete transparency before you purchase. Here is who will benefit most, and who should pass.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="who-grid">
      <!-- Who It's For -->
      <div class="who-card who-for">
        <div class="who-card-header">
          <div class="who-icon icon-check">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>This System Is Built For You If:</h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="who-list" role="list">
          <li>
            <strong>You have limited quiet time:</strong> You need guidance that can be implemented in realistic 30, 60, or 90-minute blocks around existing life commitments.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You value calm, practical honesty:</strong> You are tired of aggressive sales pitches, loud claims, and complicated funnels, and just want clear steps.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You want to keep costs at zero:</strong> You prefer to use reputable free software and tools rather than paying $100+/month in subscriptions before earning anything.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You are ready to focus on one path:</strong> You understand that committing to one clear, focused business model is how real traction happens.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Who It's Not For -->
      <div class="who-card who-not">
        <div class="who-card-header">
          <div class="who-icon icon-cross">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
              <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Please Do Not Buy If:</h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="who-list" role="list">
          <li>
            <strong>You are expecting overnight riches:</strong> Building independent income requires genuine effort, consistency, and patience. There are no magic buttons.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You are looking for passive "done-for-you" systems:</strong> These guides provide clear templates and instructions, but the actual execution is up to you.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You are interested in MLMs or crypto:</strong> We do not cover multi-level marketing, recruitment models, or speculative trading of any kind.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You prefer theoretical textbooks:</strong> Everything in this kit is direct, action-oriented, and concise. If you want 400 pages of academic theory, this is not that.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-who {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .who-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .who-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .who-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .who-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .who-card-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-headline);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .who-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-check {
    background: var(--sage-100);
    color: var(--sage-800);
  }

  .icon-cross {
    background: #FDF2EE;
    color: var(--terracotta);
  }

  .who-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .who-list li {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  .who-list strong {
    color: var(--text-headline);
  }
</style>
